Diagram D.1 — The gap functional Delta_k

```
   regret R_k
      ^
      |
      |     * <- f_hat_j
      |    /
      |   /        lower envelope E(t) = min{R_k : NDCG >= t}
      |  /
      | /   *
      |/  /
      +--*------------------------> NDCG
      | / \
      |/   * <- f_hat_j'
      |
      |

   For predictor f_hat_j at NDCG t_j:

       Delta_k(f_hat_j; f)  =  R_k(f_hat_j; f)  -  E(t_j)
                                     |               |
                                     v               v
                               actual regret     best achievable
                               of THIS pred.     regret among all
                                                 preds with NDCG >= t_j

   INTERPRETATION:
   Delta_k = excess decision penalty paid
   for using THIS predictor at THIS NDCG level
   when a better predictor exists at the same
   ranking quality.

   TARGET BOUND:
       Delta_k <= C * Var(f near top-k) / delta_k^2
```

