Diagram D.2 — Lower-envelope construction algorithmically

```
   1. Compute (NDCG_j, R_j) for j = 1..N
         _______________________
        |  NDCG_1   R_1         |
        |  NDCG_2   R_2         |
        |   ...      ...        |
        |  NDCG_N   R_N         |
        |_______________________|

   2. Sort points by NDCG ascending
         t_1 <= t_2 <= ... <= t_N

   3. Sweep right-to-left, accumulate min:
         E(t_N)     = R_N
         E(t_{N-1}) = min(R_{N-1}, E(t_N))
